+ host.innerHTML=`<header class="dk-heading"><small>NFL · DRAFTKINGS CLASSIC</small><h2>Build a lineup you can understand</h2><p>Real salaries. Your players. Two clear research objectives.</p>${S.parsed?.slate?.date?`<p class="dk-note"><b>Imported slate: ${esc(S.parsed.slate.date)} · ${S.parsed.slate.gameIds.length} games</b> · game set from your file, not an assumed Sunday schedule.</p>`:''}</header>
